🎐
"Chimes"/en
=== start/en
¶Five chimes hanging in a row, numbered one to five. Press A, S, D, F, or G and
the chime you strike swells and brightens, then settles back to rest. The whole
row sways a little whether or not anyone is playing.

It is an instrument. It makes no sound. The numerals are already a score; they
are just not being played yet. The elided block above the stage is the sound,
waiting for @Music to exist.¶

pressed: Key()
tick: Time(30ms)

¶How much of its ring a chime loses each frame.¶
decay: 0.03

¶One chime: which degree it is, which key strikes it, where it hangs, its hue,
and how hard it is still ringing — 1 just struck, 0 at rest.¶
•Chime(degree•# key•'' x•#m hue•#° energy•#)

¶Strike the chime whose key was pressed, and let every other chime settle.¶
ƒ ring(row•[Chime] hit•'' struck•?)
	row.translate(ƒ(chime•Chime)
		(struck & (hit = chime.key))
			? chime.energy: 1
			chime.energy: (chime.energy - decay).max(0))

chimes•[Chime]: [
	Chime(1 'a' -6m 20° 0)
	Chime(2 's' -3m 75° 0)
	Chime(3 'd' 0m 140° 0)
	Chime(4 'f' 3m 205° 0)
	Chime(5 'g' 6m 270° 0)
] … (∆ pressed | ∆ tick) … ring(chimes pressed (∆ pressed))

¶A chime swells and brightens with its ring, and always sways a little, so the
row is alive even when nobody is playing.¶
ƒ chimeView(chime•Chime)
	Phrase(
		(chime.degree → '')
		(2m + (chime.energy · 1.5m))
		place: Place(chime.x 0m)
		duration: 0.12s
		color: Color((45% + (chime.energy · 40%)) (20 + (chime.energy · 80)) chime.hue)
		resting: Sequence(sway(3°) 2.5s)
	)

¶The key that strikes each chime, printed underneath it.¶
ƒ keyView(chime•Chime)
	Phrase(chime.key 0.7m place: Place(chime.x -3m) color: Color(60% 0 0°))

¶These two bindings are the whole of the sound: find the chime ringing this
instant, and hand its degree to a bell, replaying on every press so each
strike is a new sound rather than the same one again. Five chimes, five
degrees of a pentatonic scale, so there is no wrong note.¶
ringing: chimes.filter(ƒ(chime•Chime) chime.energy = 1)
song: 🎼(
	🎶(ringing ↦ ⬚.degree instrument: 🔈.🔔 loop: ⊥)
	scale: 🎼.pentatonic
	replay: ∆ pressed
)

Stage(
	[
		Phrase('━━━━━━━━━━━━━' 1m place: Place(-6m 2.5m) color: Color(45% 0 0°))
		:chimes ↦ chimeView(⬚)
		:chimes ↦ keyView(⬚)
		song
	]
	background: Color(16% 15 280°)
	color: Color(95% 0 0°)
)
